alue of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids in Hanson County came in under 90% of normal in January to February 39 years out of 75, more than any other pair of months since 1951. In 2025 that same pair ran 32% of normal on the middle of the grids, and September to October ran 52%. So far in 2026 the middle of the grids shows 16% for January to February and 32% for February to March. Grid 28029 had its driest year in 1980 at 54% of normal.</p>"}
